# MealKit tuning (Tuning). Edit it in the editor's [Tuning] panel.
@format tuning 1
countdown 3
roundLength 180
roundEndDelay 4
goalHold 1
move.speed 6.5
move.jumpSpeed 8
gravity 0 -20 0
respawn 2
shoveCooldown 1.5
shoveRadius 3.5
shoveStun 2.5
catchRadius 1.1
catchRest 4
reviveRadius 2.5
reviveTime 1.5
chaserMove.speed 7
chaserSpeedScale 0.72
sightRadius 22
aiThink 0.75
wanderRadius 8
